WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
The real front door, on camera. A test account is prepared by the harness — nothing else is assisted.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.500
A business owner who wants more customers finding them.

00:08.500 --> 00:14.500
The request, typed in plain words: a landing page — and an automation that emails every booking.

00:14.500 --> 00:21.500
The machine reads it back before spending anything: sections, the automation, and the checks it must pass.

00:21.500 --> 00:26.500
The build starts. Real execution on production — this is not a mock-up.

00:26.500 --> 00:34.500
Eight seconds later: the website is built, checked, and published.

00:34.500 --> 00:50.500
The page itself — written from the owner's words. Services, dentists, hours, and a working booking form.

00:50.500 --> 01:18.000
Meanwhile the automation half is generated and independently verified before delivery.

01:18.000 --> 01:24.000
Delivered: a working automation beside the live site. Every step left a receipt.
